# Validation run: the acquisition of pet_imaging's macro/main.mac, two time slices
# of 120 s (the gantry orbits by 22.5 deg in between).
# Parameter file of simulation/pet_gate10.py (every command exactly once); the
# geometry, sources and digitizer are fixed in the script, as in pet_imaging.
/pet/physicsList          G4EmStandardPhysics_option3
/pet/productionCut        1 mm
/pet/randomSeed           auto
/pet/numberOfThreads      1
/pet/timeSlice            120 s
/pet/timeStop             240 s
